        "original_id": "f51437b7-aa0e-5904-bdd2-3c45fb069a7c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jamal Igle, Geoff Johns, James Robinson, Sterling Gates, Gary Frank, Alex Ross, Renato Guedes, Pete Woods\n- Projects: Molly Danger, Supergirl, Firestorm, Superman: New Krypton\n- Companies: DC Comics\n- Concepts: fictional superheroes, comic book series, story arc\n\nFacts:\n- Jamal Igle created the comic book series Molly Danger.\n- Jamal Igle is known for pencilling, inking, and coloring work on Supergirl and Firestorm.\n- Firestorm is the name of several fictional superheroes appearing in American comic books published by DC Comics.\n- Superman: New Krypton is a 2008–2009 Superman story arc published by DC Comics.\n- Geoff Johns, James Robinson, and Sterling Gates wrote Superman: New Krypton.\n- Gary Frank, Alex Ross, Renato Guedes, Jamal Igle, and Pete Woods created the art for Superman: New Krypton.",
